{"type":"text","timestamp":1778975879386,"sessionID":"ses_1ccc67d37ffefLbnlkOGwKYW9H","part":{"id":"prt_e33399fae001TJnzwWIRm5nyW0","messageID":"msg_e333999ca0014JjsdkuPaWAbGa","sessionID":"ses_1ccc67d37ffefLbnlkOGwKYW9H","type":"text","text":"Issue #3346 is clear: broaden existing `intraepithelial lymphocyte`, add `intestinal intraepithelial lymphocyte`, preserve existing references, add the requested PMID/Wikipedia reference, ORCID contributor, and link the tracker item. I’ll now inspect the relevant ontology axioms and parent terms before editing.","time":{"start":1778975874990,"end":1778975879380}}}
